@host = http://localhost:5141
@date = 2026-11-16

### Sign in. Put the accessToken of the answer into @token below.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "manager", "password": "<Auth__DemoPassword from .env>" }

###
@token = <paste the accessToken here>

### Lines the caller may see (a manager sees all, others only their own)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/lines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### KPI cards
GET {{host}}/api/v1/kpi/summary?date={{date}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Plan vs actual per hour
GET {{host}}/api/v1/plan-vs-actual?date={{date}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### FPY by station
GET {{host}}/api/v1/fpy/stations?date={{date}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### FPY trend
GET {{host}}/api/v1/fpy/trend?from=2026-11-10&to={{date}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Defect Pareto and DPMO
GET {{host}}/api/v1/defects/pareto?from=2026-11-10&to={{date}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Shifts
GET {{host}}/api/v1/shifts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Thresholds
GET {{host}}/api/v1/config/thresholds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
